+
+### Correctness checking
+
+Every driver checks the numbers it reports against the input column, outside
+the timed region. Before a cell is timed, the reads its timed loop will issue
+are replayed and compared element-wise: every probe of the point trace, the
+range of a range cell, the full range list of a gather cell, the whole column
+for bulk decode, encode and compression. After timing, the output buffer of
+the last timed iteration is compared again, so an arm whose warm reads differ
+from its first is caught too. FPE/fpe_noindex encodes the multiset rather
+than the sequence, so its full decode is checked as a permutation of the
+input and its partial reads against that decode.
+
